# Copy to `instances`. One line for each running build that keeps state.
# Each gets a role and a schema of this name. The name is the id the build
# has on the wire: lower case letters, digits and `_`, starting with a letter.
# A build that can run more than once in a home gets one line per instance.
# The applier and each `bridge_*` line also get a broker identity; no other build has one.
# `watch`, or `watch-<n>` for each more at once, is a read-only broker identity for a tool that
# only reads (README, *Watchers*): no role, no schema.
applier
steward
# voice_kitchen
# bridge_zigbee
# watch
